# FHM2D Extract Artifact Isolation

The cross-agent hub is `AGENTS.md`; read it and `docs/fhm2d-extract-cli.md` before
using `fhm2d-extract` / `fhm2d_extract`.

## When to use this CLI

- Prefer the default-built agent CLI **`fhm2d_extract`** for unpacking OB
  `.fhm2d` archives from the terminal (required `--type`, required `--layout`).
- Do **not** use the legacy bin `fhm2d_extract_folder` (needs
  `legacy-cli-tools`) unless the user explicitly asks for it.
- Stage SceneEdit rename extract and unit-model regroup extract remain separate
  Tauri paths; this rule covers the standalone CLI and any agent-side unpack
  smoke that mirrors it.

## Artifact location (mandatory)

- Put **every** persisted artifact created while preparing, running, or
  validating `fhm2d-extract` under the repository-root `tmp/` directory.
- Prefer a task-scoped directory: `tmp/fhm2d-extract/<task>/`.
- Covered artifacts include:
  - `--output` extract folders
  - sibling `*_structure.json` (written next to the output folder name)
  - `meta.bin` when `--write-meta-bin` is used
  - redirected CLI stdout/stderr, reports, logs, diffs, and temporary fixtures
- Treat source `.fhm2d` assets as **read-only** inputs. Never extract into the
  same directory as the source pack, into game `data\x64`, into workspace
  `com\file` trees, `docs/`, `src-tauri/`, or the repository root — unless the
  user **explicitly** requests that exact path.
- From the repository root, use `tmp/...`; from `src-tauri/`, use `../tmp/...`.
- Console-only output is not a file artifact. If it must be retained, redirect
  it under `tmp/`.
- `tmp/` is gitignored. Do not force-add generated artifacts to version control.

## Build / run defaults

- Debug only: `cargo build --bin fhm2d_extract` →
  `src-tauri/target/debug/fhm2d_extract.exe`
- Do not use `--release` unless the user asks (see
  `.cursor/rules/no-release-builds.mdc`).

## Example (from `src-tauri/`)

```powershell
$task = "..\tmp\fhm2d-extract\<task>"
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force $task | Out-Null
cargo build --bin fhm2d_extract
.\target\debug\fhm2d_extract.exe "E:\path\to\0xXXXXXXXX.fhm2d" `
  --output "$task\pack" `
  --type motion `
  --layout folder `
  2>&1 | Tee-Object -FilePath "$task\extract.log"
# Files: ..\tmp\fhm2d-extract\<task>\pack\
# Structure sidecar: ..\tmp\fhm2d-extract\<task>\pack_structure.json
```

## Required flags (no silent defaults)

| Flag | Rule |
|------|------|
| `--type` / `-t` | Required. Missing/invalid → fail. No default to `msc`. |
| `--layout` / `-l` | Required: `folder` or `flat`. |
| `--output` / `-o` | Must resolve under repo `tmp/` for agent runs. |

Types: `character`, `effect`, `motion`, `msc`, `sound`, `character_param`,
`character_cost`, `all_nutexb`, `stage_list`, `list` (also `fhm2d_*` ids).
